fn kt_byte hi uchar lo uchar to uchar
ret uchar or shl kt_hex hi 4 kt_hex lo
end
fn kt_sz wire edit uchar 64 k ulong v ulong to void
for i ulong 8
put wire add mul k 8 i uchar and shr v mul i 8 255
end
